Hi all,
Basically the tobit model in zelig is a wrapper arround the survreg function
from the package survival
You will get the same error , Check the following conversation

 http://n4.nabble.com/library-survival-cluster-td960795.html#a960795

So basically it was a bug in the package survival which has been corrected
for .
So update your current version of the survival package to its latest version
And zelig + tobit model will work fine with the cluster option.


